[size=5][b]Server & gameplay update[/b][/size]

Everything new on the server since the last server post (19 October 2026). [b](in-game)[/b] = played and verified in the game through normal controls, including a save and relog. [b](tests)[/b] = covered by automated tests only, not yet shown in game.

[b]Skilling[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Fishing[/b]: 94 spot types: nets, bait, rods, cages and harpoons; bait used per catch; stops on a full pack [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Firemaking[/b]: tinderbox on normal to yew logs, light logs on the ground, fires burn out to ashes and can be cooked on [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Gem rocks[/b] (level 40, members) with their own gem tables, depletion and 99-tick respawn [b](in-game)[/b]; random gems while mining ordinary rocks [b](tests)[/b]
[*][b]Clay and essence[/b]: clay respawns after 2 ticks; essence never depletes; pure essence at Mining 30+ for members; mining continues to a full pack [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Coal bag[/b]: Fill/Open/Check/Empty/Close; mined coal goes into an open bag; furnaces use bag coal [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Smithing extras[/b]: Goldsmith gauntlets (gold bar XP 22.5 → 56.2), smelting catalysts, ring of forging (140 charges per player), Godsword blade joining [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Sheep shearing[/b]: wool, regrowth, wool to the ground on a full pack, bleating [b](in-game)[/b]
[/list]

