[b]Combat & NPCs[/b]
[list]
[*][b]NPC combat stats[/b] now come from the game cache for every NPC [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Dragon longsword special (Cleave)[/b]: spec bar and orb, 25% cost, regeneration, low-energy refusal; energy kept across restart [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Goblin (3028)[/b] now has the Wiki's 5 hitpoints; kills, bones and a 35-tick respawn [b](in-game)[/b]
[/list]

