[b]Drops & loot[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Shared drop tables[/b]: herb, gem, rare and mega-rare, plus extra rolls (e.g. clue scrolls) [b](tests)[/b]
[*][b]Goblins and men/women[/b]: 27 + 27 variants with their own tables; drops private to the killer, then public [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Cows and calves[/b] always drop cowhide and raw beef [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Chickens, imps, bears, small spiders[/b]: corrected tables [b](tests)[/b]
[/list]

