[b]World & NPC behaviour[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Aggressive NPCs[/b] hunt players (cache settings, plus giant rats and muggers from the Wiki); they ignore players over twice their level [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Respawn timers[/b] for chickens, cows, goblins, giant rats and guards; cow respawn at exactly 45 ticks [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Ambient NPCs[/b]: cows moo and graze, ducks quack, ducklings answer, item refusals [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Banking[/b]: Lumbridge bank booths open the bank; banknotes turn back into items at booths and bankers [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Item packs[/b]: 14 new pack types (TzHaar runes, bolts, arrowheads, clay, Hunter traps…); members-only for free accounts [b](in-game)[/b]
[*][b]Picket gates[/b] open and close from both sides [b](in-game)[/b]; chicken coop eggs [b](tests)[/b]
[/list]

